  "final_message": "Wait for background task to complete.\nI'll wait for `npm test` to finish.\nI am waiting for the test suite run to finish.\nI will wait for the test task to complete.\nI will wait for git log to finish.\nI will wait for the git log command.\nI will wait for the architecture check to complete.\nI will wait for the task to finish.\nI will wait for `npm run arch` to complete.\nI will wait for `npm run arch` to complete.\nI will wait for `npm test` to complete.\nI will wait for the test run to finish.\nI will wait for `npm run typecheck` to finish.\nI will wait for `npm run typecheck` to finish.\nI will wait for `npm run arch` to finish.\nI will wait for `npm run arch` to finish.\nI will wait for `git diff` to complete.\nI will wait for `git diff` to finish.\nThe [`OrderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w6/r/src/core/events.ts#L7-L33) event has been updated to use `amountCents` and `createdAt` to align naming with the Payments and Customer APIs.\n\n### Architecture Compliance (ARCH-4)\nPer **ARCH-4** (`OrderPlaced` and `OrderCancelled` are consumed by services in other repositories such as `billing-service` and `analytics-ingest; changes are additive; renames and removals go through deprecation`):\n- The new fields `amountCents` and `createdAt` were added to [`OrderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w6/r/src/core/events.ts#L7-L33).\n- The existing fields `totalCents` and `placedAt` are preserved and marked with `@deprecated` so deployed consumers continue to function without disruption.\n- Both new and deprecated fields are populated in [`orderPlaced()`](file:///C:/avg/w6/r/src/core/events.ts#L52-L73).\n\n### Changes Made\n1. **[`src/core/events.ts`](file:///C:/avg/w6/r/src/core/events.ts)**:\n   - Added `createdAt: string` and `amountCents: number` to [`OrderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w6/r/src/core/events.ts#L7-L33).\n   - Marked `placedAt` and `totalCents` as `@deprecated`.\n   - Updated [`orderPlaced()`](file:///C:/avg/w6/r/src/core/events.ts#L52-L73) to populate `createdAt` alongside `placedAt`, and `amountCents` alongside `totalCents`.\n2. **[`test/app.test.ts`](file:///C:/avg/w6/r/test/app.test.ts)** & **[`test/adapters.test.ts`](file:///C:/avg/w6/r/test/adapters.test.ts)**:\n   - Updated test assertions to verify `createdAt` and `amountCents` as well as the preserved backward-compatible fields.\n\nAll tests (`npm test`), type checks (`npm run typecheck`), and architecture dependency cruiser checks (`npm run arch`) pass cleanly.\n",
